{"title":"Physics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is a resources page for students interested in <b>Physics competitions</b>.  Please add quality resources.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#International_Physics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">International Physics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#National_Physics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National Physics competitions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Canada\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Canada</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#United_States\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">United States</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Regional_Physics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Regional Physics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Past_Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past Contests</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Online_Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Online Resources</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"International_Physics_competitions\">International Physics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: International Physics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Physics_Olympiad\" title=\"International Physics Olympiad\">International Physics Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jyu.fi/ipho\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Online_Physics_Olympiad\" title=\"Online Physics Olympiad\">Online Physics Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//opho.physoly.tech/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Physics_Online_Olympiad_(IPhOO)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"International Physics Online Olympiad (IPhOO) (page does not exist)\">International Physics Online Olympiad (IPhOO)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://onlinescienceolympiads.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rudolf_Ortvay_Problem_Solving_Contest_in_Physics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Rudolf Ortvay Problem Solving Contest in Physics (page does not exist)\">Rudolf Ortvay Problem Solving Contest in Physics</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://ortvay.elte.hu/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=The_University_Physics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"The University Physics Competition (page does not exist)\">The University Physics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.uphysicsc.com\">website</a></li>\n<li><b>Physics Brawl Online</b> – next on <b>22nd November 2023</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physicsbrawl.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><b>FYKOS</b> – Physics Correspondence Competition <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://fykos.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><b>Fyziklani</b> - next on <b>16th February 2024</b> in Prague <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://fyziklani.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><b>Naboj Physics</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://physics.naboj.org/sk/en/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Princeton_University_Physics_Competition\" title=\"Princeton University Physics Competition\">Princeton University Physics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physics.princeton.edu/pupc/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_Physics_competitions\">National Physics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: National Physics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Canada\">Canada</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Canada\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Association_of_Physicists_High_School_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Canadian Association of Physicists High School Competition (page does not exist)\">Canadian Association of Physicists High School Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physics.usask.ca/~pywell/HighSchool/index.html\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"United_States\">United States</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: United States\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=United_States_Physics_Olympiad\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United States Physics Olympiad\">United States Physics Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aapt.org/Contests/olympiad.cfm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=F%3Dma_Exam\" title=\"F=ma Exam\">F=ma</a> (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://aapt.org/physicsteam/PT-landing.cfm\">website</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Association_of_PhysicsTeachers_Physics_Bowl\" title=\"American Association of PhysicsTeachers Physics Bowl\">American Association of PhysicsTeachers Physics Bowl</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aapt.org/Contests/physicsbowl.cfm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Auburn_Physics_Invitation&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Auburn Physics Invitation (page does not exist)\">Auburn Physics Invitation</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.physics.auburn.edu/~msimon/InvBro99-2K.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Iowa_State_Physics_Olympics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Iowa State Physics Olympics (page does not exist)\">Iowa State Physics Olympics</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.educ.drake.edu/gerlovich/physics%20olympics/physics_olympics.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=NJAAPT_Physics_Olympics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NJAAPT Physics Olympics (page does not exist)\">NJAAPT Physics Olympics</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.njaapt.org/PhysicsOlympics/2005-2006/NJ%20Physics%20Olympics%202005-2006.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Princeton_University_Physics_Competition\" title=\"Princeton University Physics Competition\">Princeton University Physics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physics.princeton.edu/pupc/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=The_Raytheon/TAPT_Annual_High_School_Physics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"The Raytheon/TAPT Annual High School Physics Competition (page does not exist)\">The Raytheon/TAPT Annual High School Physics Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=St._Louis_Area_Physics_Teachers_Physics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"St. Louis Area Physics Teachers Physics Competition (page does not exist)\">St. Louis Area Physics Teachers Physics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.slapt.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_COE/SDSA_Physics_Team_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"San Diego COE/SDSA Physics Team Competition (page does not exist)\">San Diego COE/SDSA Physics Team Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.sdsa.org/Physics/about.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Unites_States_Physics_Olympiad\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unites States Physics Olympiad\">Unites States Physics Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aapt.org/Contests/olympiad.cfm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Alabama_High_School_Physics_contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Alabama High School Physics contest (page does not exist)\">University of Alabama High School Physics contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://bama.ua.edu/~physics/Contest2006.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Miami_Physics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Miami Physics Competition (page does not exist)\">University of Miami Physics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.physics.miami.edu/competition/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Michigan_Physics_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Michigan Physics Olympiad (page does not exist)\">University of Michigan Physics Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://phys-advlab.physics.lsa.umich.edu/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNC-Charlotte_Physics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"UNC-Charlotte Physics Competition (page does not exist)\">UNC-Charlotte Physics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://education.uncc.edu/aewickli/supercomp1.htm#Physics\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Iowa_Regional_Physics_Olympics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"University of Northern Iowa Regional Physics Olympics (page does not exist)\">University of Northern Iowa Regional Physics Olympics</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.physics.uni.edu/uni_aea267_olympics.shtml\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Utah_Physics_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Utah Physics Olympiad (page does not exist)\">Utah Physics Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://departments.weber.edu/sciencecenter/ScienceOlympiad/Olympiadpage.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Western_Kentucky_Physics_Olympics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Western Kentucky Physics Olympics (page does not exist)\">Western Kentucky Physics Olympics</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physics.wku.edu/olympics/events.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Yale_Physics_Olympics\" title=\"Yale Physics Olympics\">Yale Physics Olympics</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://wnsl.physics.yale.edu/events/olympics/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Regional_Physics_competitions\">Regional Physics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Regional Physics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Asian_Physics_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Asian Physics Olympiad (page does not exist)\">Asian Physics Olympiad</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.apho.org/en/home/index.php?charencode=en\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ibero-American_Physics_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ibero-American Physics Olympiad (page does not exist)\">Ibero-American Physics Olympiad</a> - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://oc.uan.edu.co/oibf/oibf.htm\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Khan Academy: AP Physics 1/2\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifylabs.com/\">CompetifyLabs</a> Custom-made topic-tailored problems across Physics preparation across honors physics to USAPHO level - earn volunteer hours from problem writing!</li>\n<li>CompetifyHub's Problem Sets <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/services-2/\">Free Competition and Learning Resources for Grades 1-12</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_Contests\">Past Contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Past Contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Boston_Area_Undergraduate_Physics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Boston Area Undergraduate Physics Competition (page does not exist)\">Boston Area Undergraduate Physics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://liquids.deas.harvard.edu/oleg/competition/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books\">Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Online_Resources\">Online Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Online Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifylabs.com/\">CompetifyLabs</a> Custom-made topic-tailored problems across Physics preparation across honors physics to USAPHO level - earn volunteer hours from problem writing!</li>\n<li>CompetifyHub's Problem Sets <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/services-2/\">Free Competition and Learning Resources for Grades 1-12</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> has a <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c164_physics\">Physics Forum linked here</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> also teaches <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/school/woot-physics\">PhysicsWOOT</a>—like WOOT, but for physics.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.physicsforums.com/\">Physics Forums</a> -- One of the largest educational forums on the web!</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://physicsweb.org/\">PhysicsWeb</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.luiseduardo.com.br/\">Physics Challenges - Problems</a> -- Collection of Challenging Physics Problems</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_books\" title=\"Physics books\">Physics books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_scholarships\" title=\"Physics scholarships\">Physics scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics\" title=\"Physics\">Physics</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018103032\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1474:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018103032 and revision id 277174. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}